Christian Thinkers Writers — licensing

This repository mixes three classes of material.

1. Public-domain source texts
   Files under cai-pipeline/books_raw/ and cai-pipeline-control/books_raw/
   are English public-domain works obtained from Project Gutenberg, Wikisource,
   and the Internet Archive. Those texts remain in the public domain.
   Project Gutenberg trademark and license headers, where present in a file,
   continue to apply to that file as distributed by Gutenberg.

2. Original code (MIT License)
   Python scripts, requirements.txt, and other original software in this
   repository are licensed under the MIT License (full text below).

3. Original documentation and generated research artifacts (CC BY 4.0)
   Coverage reports, protocols, census and scoring tables, constitutions,
   prompt sets, SL-CAI / RLAIF JSONL, and related project documentation
   created for this archive are licensed under Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

